# createPost / createEphemeralPost — the decisions a reader could plausibly get wrong.
# Every line is the `api` suite filtered to `post_creates`; the two CONTROLs are at the end.
#
# The forward conditions are first, because a forward condition no test can see is the most
# dangerous line in this change: dropping one serves a request Go would have answered
# differently, silently, with a row already written.
